# ---- DFO data available on request -------------------------------------------
# Commercial catch (reduction, food and bait, roe) and total allowable catch were
# provided by Fisheries and Oceans Canada and are available from DFO on request, as
# is the detailed catch series derived from them.
SOG_herring_catch_all_fishing_types*.csv
